    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-systems-intro",
        "moduleId": "mod-nosql",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "大数据管理系统概述",
        "markdown": "面对大数据的存储和处理需求，业界发展出多种新型数据管理系统。教材重点介绍了NoSQL数据管理系统、NewSQL数据库系统和MapReduce技术，以及它们在大数据生态系统中的定位。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000772"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "大数据管理系统"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12365,
              "lineEnd": 12370,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e38f0b801e5bfdbeb37cb8c3f0aaa2894da3816e3bcc0bf8cb8d5498468ccc51"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-nosql",
        "moduleId": "mod-nosql",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "NoSQL数据管理系统",
        "markdown": "NoSQL数据库采用非关系数据模型，放宽了传统数据库的一致性约束，以换取更高的可扩展性和灵活性。常见类型包括键值存储、文档数据库、列族存储和图数据库，分别适用于不同的数据结构和访问模式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000773"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "NoSQL 数据管理系统"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12371,
              "lineEnd": 12388,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ee136bbad6c0303f54ab02862b1852c3eee780a37bb75186831537e26e4f75c5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-nosql-reason",
        "moduleId": "mod-nosql",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "为什么需要NoSQL",
        "markdown": "传统关系数据库在水平扩展方面面临瓶颈。NoSQL通过简化数据模型、采用最终一致性策略和分布式架构，能够轻松扩展到数百甚至数千台服务器，满足互联网级应用的吞吐需求。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-nosql"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-newsql",
        "moduleId": "mod-nosql",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "NewSQL数据库系统",
        "markdown": "NewSQL试图在保持关系模型和ACID事务的同时实现水平扩展。它结合传统数据库的强一致性保证和NoSQL的高可扩展性，为操作型大数据应用提供了新的选择。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000774"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "NewSQL 数据库系统"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12389,
              "lineEnd": 12398,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "897ef2c6cda83ebe08a36f540b2bfd1a4346c83ef6a7eb4a2d98c88b92044c62"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mapreduce",
        "moduleId": "mod-mapreduce",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "MapReduce技术",
        "markdown": "MapReduce是一种面向大规模数据集的并行计算模型。它将复杂计算分解为Map（映射）和Reduce（归约）两个阶段，通过分布式处理实现高吞吐量的批处理计算。Hadoop是MapReduce模型的典型开源实现。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000775"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "MapReduce 技术"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12399,
              "lineEnd": 12427,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/f92c13119d26d66681c55b21244ca5955d22da09facf0d9671e49d112720c793.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "a2011c687cc582279dfedfa874a05b00063930a438398ea9fb7c879934af6611"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-mapreduce-example",
        "moduleId": "mod-mapreduce",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "MapReduce计算示例",
        "markdown": "以词频统计为例：Map阶段将每篇文章拆分为单词并输出（单词,1）键值对；Reduce阶段汇总相同单词的计数并输出最终频率。这一过程天然适合在集群中并行执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-mapreduce"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-landscape",
        "moduleId": "mod-landscape",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "大数据管理系统的新格局",
        "markdown": "当前大数据管理系统形成了四类主要技术：面向操作型应用的关系数据库技术、面向分析型应用的关系数据库技术、面向操作型应用的NoSQL技术，以及面向分析型应用的MapReduce技术。不同技术在一致性、扩展性和查询能力之间存在权衡。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
